CM_ BO_ 257 "ECU1 BodyStatus sent every 100 ms and monitored by ECU6/CANoe.";
CM_ BO_ 513 "ECU2 PowertrainStatus sent every 50 ms and monitored by ECU6/CANoe.";
CM_ BO_ 769 "ECU3 SensorStatus sent every 100 ms and monitored by ECU6/CANoe.";
CM_ BO_ 1025 "ECU4 ClusterStatus sent every 100 ms and monitored by ECU6/CANoe.";
CM_ BO_ 1281 "ECU5 DiagnosticStatus sent every 100 ms and monitored by ECU6/CANoe.";
CM_ BO_ 1537 "ECU6 GatewayStatus sent every 100 ms. ECU4 and CANoe decode gateway, OTA, and security status.";
CM_ BO_ 1616 "Event-based OTA request frame from CANoe panel or test to ECU6.";
CM_ BO_ 1617 "Event-based OTA response frame from ECU6 to CANoe.";
CM_ BO_ 2015 "Event-based UDS functional request from CANoe to ECU5/ECU6 on CAN ID 0x7DF.";
CM_ BO_ 2016 "Event-based UDS physical request from CANoe to ECU5 on CAN ID 0x7E0.";
CM_ BO_ 2024 "Event-based UDS response from ECU5 to CANoe on CAN ID 0x7E8.";

CM_ SG_ 513 VehicleSpeedKph "Requirement valid range: 0..220 km/h. Raw byte capacity remains available for invalid-value injection.";
CM_ SG_ 513 EngineRPM "Requirement valid range: 0..8000 rpm. Scaling is 50 rpm/bit.";
CM_ SG_ 513 EngineTempC "Requirement valid range: -40..150 degC. Raw byte capacity remains available for invalid-value injection.";
CM_ SG_ 769 AmbientTempC "Requirement valid range: -40..85 degC.";
CM_ SG_ 769 BatteryVoltage "Requirement valid range: 6..18 V. Scaling is 0.1 V/bit.";
CM_ SG_ 769 SteeringAngleDeg "Signed 16-bit little-endian steering angle. Requirement valid range: -540..540 deg.";
CM_ SG_ 1025 ClusterState "Requirement states: INIT, NORMAL, WARNING, DIAG_MODE, OTA_MODE, FAIL_SAFE.";

